00:57:24.190 --> 00:57:26.530
Well, it's the first time I've ever ridden with a mummy.

00:57:27.390 --> 00:57:29.790
I'll open the door to the shed. We'll leave it there.

00:57:30.000 --> 00:57:33.800
You mean we're gonna put it in there wouldn't want to leave him on me outside

00:57:33.800 --> 00:57:38.560
Would you suppose it rains to be careful when you get in I'll get this

00:57:39.450 --> 00:57:42.830
I'll get here Bob you get corner

00:58:55.430 --> 00:58:59.700
I'm afraid if we try opening it here we may destroy something yes sometimes

00:59:00.000 --> 00:59:02.920
Just exposing a body to the air will cause it to fall apart.

