01:01:00.000 --> 01:01:05.140
until later on this evening just before we go to bed but i think right now at any rate we should

01:01:05.140 --> 01:01:25.620
all eat dinner good idea i could use something but seriously it was a great trip boy it sounds

01:01:25.620 --> 01:01:29.000
like it this day certainly could go by fast

01:01:30.190 --> 01:01:32.330
I wish I would have gone with you guys when he climbed up his rock.

01:01:33.430 --> 01:01:34.730
That was quite an experience.

01:01:35.400 --> 01:01:36.380
And where were we?

01:01:36.750 --> 01:01:37.950
Waiting, down below.

01:01:38.580 --> 01:01:41.840
Well, when I looked up and saw that ledge and that sheer cliff,

01:01:42.410 --> 01:01:45.110
well, I always feel a lot better on solid ground.

01:01:45.370 --> 01:01:48.450
So next week, all the newspapers are bringing big stories

01:01:48.450 --> 01:01:49.990
