01:01:50.250 --> 01:01:51.370
Maybe even magazines.

01:01:52.130 --> 01:01:53.030
Well, what's wrong with that?

01:01:53.230 --> 01:01:53.410
Yeah.

01:01:53.630 --> 01:01:56.150
They'll be asking me what I did, what happened,

01:01:56.550 --> 01:01:59.970
what did I do when I first saw that mummy lying there in that...

01:02:00.000 --> 01:02:02.400
like it has been for thousands of years.

01:02:02.850 --> 01:02:04.130
