01:02:04.480 --> 01:02:07.080
That I didn't do anything, because I wasn't even in the cave.

01:02:07.530 --> 01:02:09.930
I was too afraid to climb up on the rock.

01:02:10.320 --> 01:02:11.500
Well, you weren't alone.

01:02:11.780 --> 01:02:15.100
I can see the pictures on the front of the school paper

01:02:15.100 --> 01:02:17.440
