01:02:17.780 --> 01:02:20.140
And all my friends asking, where were you?

01:02:20.940 --> 01:02:22.300
Tell them you took the picture.

01:02:23.540 --> 01:02:23.980
Thanks.

01:02:25.660 --> 01:02:27.320
Well, I should go for a bottle of pop.

01:02:27.960 --> 01:02:29.940
The country store is open until 9 o'clock.

01:02:30.030 --> 01:02:35.080
walk if you want to walk up there. How far is it? If you cut through the orange

01:02:35.080 --> 01:02:39.420
grove it isn't far, about a ten minute walk. There's a well-worn path

