01:03:13.540 --> 01:03:20.280
Where's the dime? Come on, take it out.

01:03:25.930 --> 01:03:28.830
And three cents deposit. Unless you want me to have to drink it there.

01:03:36.030 --> 01:03:38.550
No, I'm going to conserve my energy and stay here.

01:05:46.860 --> 01:05:47.360
Number three.

01:06:22.460 --> 01:06:22.600
Roll.

