01:09:01.610 --> 01:09:03.350
If we stay in the path, we'll be okay.

01:09:04.070 --> 01:09:05.410
Yeah, if we can see it well enough.

01:09:23.260 --> 01:09:24.740
Johnny and Sharon will meet you here.

01:09:47.180 --> 01:09:47.360
coming.

