01:21:06.440 --> 01:21:07.540
And I'll be on this radio.

01:21:19.920 --> 01:21:20.200
Roger?

01:21:29.520 --> 01:21:29.980
You're more...

01:21:30.670 --> 01:21:57.210
We'll be back in a few minutes. Be careful.

01:22:50.412 --> 01:22:50.952
Jareth ready.

01:22:51.852 --> 01:22:54.032
He's got a good view through the grove from where he's parked.

01:22:54.348 --> 01:22:56.148
Yes, we've already communicated with him.

01:23:03.388 --> 01:23:06.388
Now all we do is wait here until it comes out of the grill.

01:23:15.868 --> 01:23:17.868
in a half hour.

01:23:36.970 --> 01:23:39.450
This is Bill Walt. See anything yet?

01:23:40.690 --> 01:23:41.390
Nothing yet.

01:23:41.600 --> 01:23:43.940
Beginning to look as if this idea isn't going to work.

01:23:48.290 --> 01:23:49.030
30 minutes anyway.

01:24:22.240 --> 01:24:22.380
Yep.

01:24:31.090 --> 01:24:32.450
You better be careful.

01:26:04.640 --> 01:26:05.580
It's been almost three minutes.

01:26:11.700 --> 01:26:17.310
Walt, come in, Walt.

01:26:21.000 --> 01:26:21.580
Nothing's wrong.

01:26:22.720 --> 01:26:24.740
Come on, bring along those players, Johnny.

01:26:25.970 --> 01:26:27.250
